      "content_md": "I know this is not going to be a one liner!\n\nIf I have a dcg hologram that comes out with the nasty greenies, I reprocess starting with water wash and then a soak in warm/hot soapy water, then three ISO alch baths. It seems to help in making it more even in color (most times when I reprocess it shifts towards green).",
